9892990562544/comments/default/3373406811799206194'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2208459892990562544/comments/default/3373406811799206194'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/08/vester-lee-flanagan-social-justice.html?showComment=1441076123946#c3373406811799206194' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/08/vester-lee-flanagan-social-justice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2208459892990562544' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2208459892990562544' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-723997741"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 31, 2015 at 8:55 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1436433124176089549</id><published>2015-08-30T17:24:36.439-06:00</published><updated>2015-08-30T17:24:36.439-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Very sad thing that happened to this woman and her...</title><content type='html'>Very sad thing that happened to this woman and her cameraman. This was racially motivated. I doubt either of them were racist people, just two young people in the prime of their lives. Obama and his surrogates such as Al Shapton have stoked racial tensions, unfortunately many innocent people have been killed because of his wreck less rhetoric and apparent hatred of White people. Not a fan of Bush or Clinton, but these types of racial killings were not as prevalent during their terms.I look forward to a new administration next year, this one has been a disaster.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2208459892990562544/comments/default/1436433124176089549'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2208459892990562544/comments/default/1436433124176089549'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/08/vester-lee-flanagan-social-justice.html?showComment=1440977076439#c1436433124176089549' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/08/vester-lee-flanagan-social-justice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2208459892990562544' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2208459892990562544' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1660561945"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 30, 2015 at 5:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1256402833209917999</id><published>2015-08-29T18:07:15.003-06:00</published><updated>2015-08-29T18:07:15.003-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This whole thing stinks to high heaven &#xa;Read&#xa;http:...</title><content type='html'>This whole thing stinks to high heaven &lt;br /&gt;Read&lt;br /&gt;http://bigdanblogger.blogspot.com/2015/08/goverment-and-media-terrorists-strike.html&lt;br /&gt;and&lt;br /&gt;https://willyloman.wordpress.com/2015/08/29/wdbj-shooting-hoax-fixing-the-narrative-the-blinded-by-the-light-addendum/&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2208459892990562544/comments/default/1256402833209917999'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2208459892990562544/comments/default/12564028332